>## Dereference a type name to get the actual type (Either version)
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term dereferenceType = λcx,graph,name.let mel := lexical.lookupBinding graph name in optionals.match mel right(none) (λel.eithers.map optionals.given (eithers.bimap (λ`_e`.errors.Error{resolution = errors.ResolutionError{unexpectedShape = errors.UnexpectedShapeError{expected = "type", actual = errors.DecodingError[] `_e`}}}) (λ`_a`.`_a`) (decode.model.type graph (model.Binding[`term`] el))))
