>## Test whether a map's key type resolves to string, following aliases and wrappers. Used to decide whether a map may use the compact JSON object encoding.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term mapKeyResolvesToString = λtypes,keyType.cases(model.Type){literal=λlt.cases(model.LiteralType){`string`=λ`_`.true, `_`=false} lt, `_`=false} (resolveBaseType types keyType)
#^^^^ source.hydra keyword.other.definition.hydra
#    ^ source.hydra
#     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra entity.name.function.hydra
#                           ^ source.hydra
#                            ^ source.hydra keyword.operator.equals.hydra
