>## Require a name to resolve to a union type
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term requireUnionType = λcx,graph,name.let toUnion := λt.cases(model.Type){`union`=λrt.given(rt), `_`=none} t in requireRowType cx "union" toUnion graph name
